concept:competition-and-consumer-legislation-amendment-act-2011-sch-2-sec-12cc-ss-1 cml:asserts concept:competition-and-consumer-legislation-amendment-act-2011-sch-2-sec-12cc-ss-1-logic-alleninterval-2 .
